  "releaseNotes": "10.0.0: first public release. PostgreSQL storage of the Users module: AddUsersPostgresDatabase (DataMagic PostgresqlDatabaseOptions) registers the user, password reset request, role and permission storage on EF Core 9 / Npgsql, and the package ships the EF Core migrations of the users tables (applied at startup only when ApplyMigrationsOnStartup is true). Depends on ApiFeatures.Authentications.Users.Cores (>= 10.0.0). Register exactly one Users database package. Versioning: the major version is the highest .NET version targeted; minor versions can be breaking, so pin an exact version.",
